# Load-bearing, even though it excludes nothing.
#
# The root .vercelignore excludes docs/ so the apex project doesn't publish
# this site. Vercel falls back to the root .vercelignore when a project's Root
# Directory has none of its own — which would make the docs project exclude
# itself and deploy empty. This file takes precedence for that project and
# ignores nothing, so the docs site ships.
#
# Everything in docs/ is intended to be public. Keep it that way: anything
# added here is served at docs.fluxcompute.dev.
